      <parameter sboTerm="SBO:0000002" id="PT_slope" name="relative increase of the PT per rivaroxaban concentration" value="628.063358133609" units="per_mM" constant="true">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
            <p>The PT is linear in the total concentration of rivaroxaban in
plasma; the PT of 10 mg in the fasted state rises to about 1.44
times its baseline at a Cmax of about 0.26 µM (Neoplastin Plus,
Kubitza2006), the less sensitive reagents of the other studies give
smaller increases.</p>
          </body>
        </notes>
